WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:08.420
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:14.930
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:16.760
It's my day!

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:27.340
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:34.750
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:42.120
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:49.530
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:55.300
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:02.440
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:09.950
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:16.090
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:19.160
I just want to walk

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:22.690
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:26.660
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:35.570
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:42.010
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:44.280
It's my day!

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:57.740
Why don't you forget Tsukasa...

00:01:57.740 --> 00:01:59.330
and go out with me?

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:00.260
Huh?

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:03.500
Am I less desirable than Tsukasa?

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.470
<i>Who is this person?</i>

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:11.040
<i>Shut up...</i>

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:15.310
<i>I'm not interested in other people...</i>

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:19.510
<i>I'll never understand women.</i>

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:24.280
<i>Is this really Rui Hanazawa?</i>

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:29.560
<i>This pick-up artist is really
the same Rui Hanazawa I know?</i>

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.230
Hey, it's a joke! I'm kidding.

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:40.170
You're so serious.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:42.570
You're really funny sometimes.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:46.040
A-a joke?!

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:54.680
"Be Still My Beating Heart"

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:57.150
After all, Tsukasa is my friend.

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.820
It'd be a bad scene all around.

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:04.120
Or are you disappointed?

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.290
Well, then...

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.930
We could date on the sly.

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:16.500
That's a joke too, right?
How funny!

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:19.100
Well, I've got class now, so...

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:25.510
Makino.

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:31.120
You've gotten a lot cuter.

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:34.060
Thanks.

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:42.030
Oh, my.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:50.630
<i>Hold on... was that for real?
What's going on?</i>

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.410
<i>Why is he so casual now?</i>

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:04.920
<i>He's become just like 
Nishikado and Mimasaka.</i>

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.220
<i>You've gotten a lot cuter.</i>

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:28.910
<i>My heart's pounding.</i>

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:31.670
<i>What's wrong with me?</i>

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:33.580
Makino?

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:37.770
What's wrong, Makino?

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:40.650
Did I scare you? I'm sorry.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:43.250
Wh-what do you want?

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.200
<i>Wh-what's up with her?</i>

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:50.790
Tsukushi, thanks for what you did
the other day.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:54.300
I hadn't thanked you yet.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.570
I really appreciated it... a lot.

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:06.930
You backed me up, even though
I did such a terrible thing to you...

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:08.610
I was so happy.

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:11.860
I guess it's a little late for this...

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:14.720
but it's true that I looked up to you.

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:17.490
You and your never-say-die attitude...

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:22.160
...though it also made me feel inferior.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.900
But I'm not giving up on Domyoji.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:29.230
Huh?

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.730
I may have been ugly in the past...

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.710
...but look how cute I am now.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:42.740
And I've got curves out to here.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.910
I wear a C-cup.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:46.620
No matter how I look at it...

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:49.760
...it's hard to believe
that he'd choose you over me.

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:57.690
Anyway, that's all I had to say.

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:01.690
Let's go nightclubbing
together some time, okay?

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:09.100
Makino.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:10.200
Yeah?

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.510
You were just with Hanazawa, right?

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:14.540
Huh?

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:19.700
Because you were blushing.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:20.580
Wha...

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:30.360
<i>What a witch.</i>

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:42.370
Get in.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.580
What's going on?

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:55.110
We're going to my family's villa.

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:59.200
V-villa? This is the 
first I've heard of it!

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:04.250
It's an awesome place.
Blue skies, miles of ocean.

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:07.260
But you never asked!
Listen to me!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:18.870
<i>He's calling all the shots.</i>

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:23.940
<i>He was always pushy,
but he's getting worse.</i>

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:26.340
<i>I have to nip this in the bud.</i>

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.380
I'm not going.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.530
My parents will get mad at me...

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:31.350
...so take me home.

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:34.510
I made a call to your house already.

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:36.140
I talked to your father...

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:37.990
and I could hear him dancing with joy.

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:39.520
Huh?

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.320
<i>Why are my parents so awful?!</i>

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.170
Is everyone aboard?

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:01.640
Yes, master.
Your guests are all here.

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:13.390
An airplane?

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:18.590
Hey, what are you doing? Get in.

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:19.730
Get in?

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.770
Can't you tell?
It's my family's private jet.

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:24.970
What?!

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:33.460
I never rode in a plane before.

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:34.840
We're going to crash!

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:37.030
We're all going to die!

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:39.250
Y-y-you're choking me.

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:41.520
L-look outside.

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:55.560
Oh! How pretty! It's beautiful!

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:58.600
Hey, wow!
We're flying above the clouds!

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:02.060
Shut up.
What's up with that girl...

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.500
...yelling and screaming.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:07.940
<i>Wow! I can't believe
I'm riding in an airplane.</i>

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:10.140
So, where are we headed?

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:12.010
To an island that my family owns.

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:16.120
An island?!
Your family owns an island?

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:16.980
Yeah.

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:20.590
<i>Th-this is unbelievable.</i>

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:23.860
<i>He's not your ordinary rich kid.</i>

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:28.430
<i>His family is really loaded.</i>

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:31.430
Makino. Let me introduce you.
Come here.

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:35.970
These two are from
Yamanote All-Girls School.

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:37.340
I'm Hiroko.

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:40.110
I'm Noriko. Nice to meet you.

00:09:40.570 --> 00:09:42.140
S-same here.

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:46.040
<i>Gee. They're your textbook
young ladies.</i>

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:48.080
And this is my girlfriend.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:50.980
Charmed.

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:54.350
H-hi. Pleased to meet you.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:55.820
Akira.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:58.560
I'm thirsty.

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:00.160
Okay, okay.

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:03.560
<i>I heard he seduced 
older women, but...</i>

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.580
<i>How perverse.</i>

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:24.180
<i>That light brown hair...</i>

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:27.180
<i>He's here.</i>

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.030
It's been a year, huh?

00:10:37.890 --> 00:10:39.930
Let's put our luggage in the rooms.

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:48.340
I almost made eye contact.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.170
Makino. Let me take
 you to your room.

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:52.910
Oh... okay.

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:56.480
Woah!

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:04.710
Do you like it?

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:06.820
It's the room with the best view.

00:11:06.820 --> 00:11:08.720
Yeah! It's beautiful!

00:11:15.030 --> 00:11:16.830
What a lovely ocean.

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:46.590
This will be...

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:48.600
our room.

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:09.680
Cheers!

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:14.450
Delicious!

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:17.050
Everything tastes great
when the air is this clean.

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:20.890
Domyoji, your family is so impressive.

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.600
They own such a lovely island.

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:27.650
Amen to that.

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:30.690
At our school, a lot of our fathers
are presidents of companies...

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:32.800
...but no one owns an island.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:36.890
Tsukasa, your family has ten
other places worldwide, right?

00:12:36.890 --> 00:12:39.550
We only have two...
one in Karuizawa and one in L.A.

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:41.810
Where were yours, Sojiro?

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:46.450
Hawaii and Hokkaido...
and one in Monaco.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:47.740
My father likes to act big...

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:50.620
...although he's the head
of a tea ceremony school.

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:51.760
What about you, Rui?

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:55.650
My family has one
 in Australia and Tahiti...

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:56.900
...and Okinawa in Japan.

00:12:57.600 --> 00:12:59.430
Wow! Awesome!

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:01.400
You F4 boys are really...

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:05.070
...such a wealthy group of young men!

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:07.330
I'm so embarrassed.

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:11.160
In our families, our fathers
are presidents of companies...

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:13.600
...but we only own
one villa each in Karuizawa.

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:15.580
What about you, Makino?

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.150
Where is your family's villa?

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:22.450
I guess... my grandma's house
in the country would be our villa.

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:23.790
Huh?

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:27.590
Grandma?

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:33.030
It doesn't make sense to own one
if you don't use it.

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:36.330
We don't even take care of our villas
in the off season.

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:41.170
Hey, the steaks are ready. Eat.

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:46.410
Oh! It looks so delicious!
Thank you.

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:48.080
What kind of sauce is this?

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:50.880
It's a red wine <i>fond de veau</i>.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:52.840
Makino...

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.390
This is yours... P-please eat.

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:05.530
<i>This will be... our room.</i>

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:20.240
<i>I wonder if...</i>

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:22.980
<i>If he's thinking that we're going to...</i>

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:26.950
<i>There was only the one king-sized bed.</i>

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.920
<i>I still feel his warmth...</i>

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:33.390
<i>...pressing against my back.</i>

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:40.160
<i>But first things first.</i>

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:41.930
<i>I haven't told him how I feel yet.</i>

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:46.120
<i>It's hard to imagine myself
with Domyoji...</i>

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:47.970
<i>...who I hated so much at first.</i>

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:00.010
<i>Not yet...</i>

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:14.430
<i>It's still inconceivable.</i>

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:20.370
I'm so jealous of you, Makino.

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:21.600
Huh?

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:24.800
Aren't you going to sleep
with Domyoji tonight?

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:28.570
Wh-where did that come from?
We're not at that point yet.

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:30.910
I'm a little scared.

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:33.410
Don't worry! I'm sure...

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:37.320
You're right. Both Hanazawa
and Nishikado seem experienced anyway.

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:40.150
Huh? D-did you say Hanazawa?

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:43.390
Yes. I'm sharing a room with him.

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:47.560
Oh! It all seems like a dream!

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:49.530
My heart's pounding.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:54.200
Of all the boys in the F4,
I liked Hanazawa the best!

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:08.010
<i>How could this have happened?</i>

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.750
<i>Why isn't he with Shizuka?</i>

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:14.020
<i>This is so stupid of me.</i>

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:17.500
<i>I thought I put an end to it...</i>

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:21.070
<i>...when Rui Hanazawa went to France
to chase after Shizuka.</i>

00:16:21.070 --> 00:16:24.360
Oh, Hanazawa!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:30.440
<i>I can't. I can't watch this anymore.</i>

00:16:46.550 --> 00:16:48.620
Makino... what's wrong?

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:56.360
Makino!

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:02.400
I... I'm going back to the room.

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.470
I'm a little tired.

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:20.880
<i>It's like there's a little bird
in my heart fluttering around.</i>

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:32.360
<i>Why am I feeling like this now?</i>

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:38.370
Do you feel sick?

00:17:39.230 --> 00:17:42.200
Oh... I'm fine.
I'm just a little tired.

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:43.880
Why don't you lie down on the bed?

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:45.840
What? The bed?

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:48.980
H-hold on. I'm not ready to...

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:51.950
I'll sleep on that sofa bed.

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:54.980
Sofa bed?

00:17:57.850 --> 00:18:00.960
Let me tell you something.
Don't get me wrong.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:04.540
I told you how I feel about you.

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:06.230
But you haven't told me
how you feel.

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:12.770
I don't want to sleep with a girl
who doesn't love me.

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:15.640
<i>Domyoji...</i>

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:18.920
Well, I am a guy.

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:21.780
And if I told you that I didn't want to,
it'd be a lie.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.850
Makino... hurry up and decide.

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:32.150
I'm getting tired of waiting.

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:54.610
<i>I wish...</i>

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:58.710
<i>...that I could feel...</i>

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:01.550
<i>...the same way, too...</i>

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:20.500
<i>But... the little bird in my heart...</i>

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:28.010
<i>Is rustling around...</i>

00:19:37.220 --> 00:19:38.920
Wh-what are you doing there?

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:43.120
Nothing. What about you?

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:45.360
Where's Tsukasa?

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:47.160
H-he went to bed.

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:03.980
Tell me... are you planning
to stay here all night long?

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:05.210
Yeah.

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:09.550
Do you feel sick?

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:12.590
You must've gotten a cold
from sitting here all this time.

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:17.050
Wh-what are you doing?

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:19.690
Ten minutes...

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:21.590
no, just five will do...

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:22.930
...hold me.

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:23.990
What?

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:29.370
I'm fine during the day,
but I can't handle the nights.

00:20:30.900 --> 00:20:32.000
I'm so cold I can't stand it.

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:35.970
But... why don't you hook up
with that girl?

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:39.220
I can't.
I don't know a thing about her.

00:22:06.430 --> 00:22:12.500
You let your hair down a little

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:20.370
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:30.250
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:30.480 --> 00:22:38.290
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:38.290 --> 00:22:46.060
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:46.330 --> 00:22:54.210
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:46.330 --> 00:22:54.210
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:54.210 --> 00:23:02.580
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:54.210 --> 00:23:02.580
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:04.380 --> 00:23:12.360
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:20.130
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:20.400 --> 00:23:28.310
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:20.400 --> 00:23:28.310
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:28.310 --> 00:23:36.710
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:28.310 --> 00:23:36.710
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:49.760 --> 00:23:50.760
I lied to Domyoji.

00:23:51.730 --> 00:23:54.000
I couldn't leave Rui Hanazawa
hurting and alone.

00:23:54.560 --> 00:23:57.800
But I felt guilty,
as if I had done something wrong...

00:23:58.830 --> 00:24:00.240
...and I lied to Domyoji.

00:24:00.900 --> 00:24:03.840
Rui Hanazawa is the only thing
that's on my mind.

00:24:04.610 --> 00:24:07.110
Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"Night of Betrayal"

00:24:08.010 --> 00:24:09.780
Why can't you be happy?
